TabbySync is source-available software, NOT open source. The source code is
published so that anyone can read and audit it — TabbySync handles your
bookmarks, your open tabs and your sync credentials, and you should be able to
verify for yourself what it does with them. Publishing the source does not
place it in the public domain and does not grant any right to redistribute it.

